strings.en:
First, the quickest way to see the whole
thing: use the sub-command's full-map view.
{wait}

For this, use the L1 and R1 buttons. It's a
feature you'll use a lot, so learn it well.
{wait}

Training: 'Rotate the map with the L1 and R1
buttons' (press the Circle button to continue)
{wait}

Training: 'Change the angle with Square + L1
or L2' (press the Circle button to continue)
{wait}

Training: 'Change the distance with Square +
R1 or R2' (press the Circle button to continue)
{wait}

All right, one last thing. It's a little different
from the map controls so far,
{wait}but it's a handy way to see units hidden
behind obstacles.
{wait}

